<title>UK: London coal/ore fixtures.</title>
<headline>London coal/ore fixtures.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>COAL - No fresh coal fixtures were reported on Wednesday.</p>
<p>ORE - Aqua Faith - 160,000 tonnes iron ore Cape Lambert/Rotterdam $7.25 fio seven days shinc 5-20/6 Robe River.</p>
<p>Brokers advise that the Docenave TBN fixture reported on May for 100,000 tonnes ore Tubarao/Sparrows Point $6.10 Bethlehem Steel has failed.</p>
</text>
